@startuml UC17_GetAssistance
autonumber

actor "Passenger" as Passenger
participant "System" as Sys
database "Airport Database" as DB
actor "Airport Administrator" as AirportAdministrator
actor "Ground Manager" as GroundManager

Passenger -> Sys : Access "Assistance" section
Sys -> Passenger : Display FAQ list
Passenger -> Sys : Contact customer support
Sys -> Passenger : Request issue details (System vs Airport)
Passenger -> Sys : Submit issue information

alt Issue about the system
    Sys -> Passenger : Redirect to UC16 (Report a Bug)
else Issue about the airport
    Sys -> DB : Create support ticket
    DB --> Sys : Ticket saved
    Sys -> AirportAdministrator : Notify support ticket
    Sys -> GroundManager : Notify support ticket
    Sys -> Passenger : Display confirmation message
end

@enduml